    "type": "def Survives (G : StrategicGame N U) : \u2115 \u2192 (i : N) \u2192 G.strategy i \u2192 Prop | 0 => fun _ _ => True | n + 1 => fun i s => G.Survives n i s \u2227 \u00ac \u2203 t : G.strategy i, G.Survives n i t \u2227 \u2200 \u03c3 : G.Profile, (\u2200 j, G.Survives n j (\u03c3 j)) \u2192 G.payoff (deviate \u03c3 i s) i < G.payoff (deviate \u03c3 i t) i /-- Survival at round n+1 implies survival at round n. -/"
